ling-nvidia-was-a-big-mistake"}], "notes": "Source: SEC EDGAR 13F-HR information-table XML, Duquesne Family Office LLC (CIK 0001536411), 18 quarters 2022-03-31..2026-06-30 (filed 2022-05-16..2026-08-14). Units: Duquesne reports values in THOUSANDS in every filing except 2022-12-31 (whole dollars); detected per-filing by raw-total magnitude and normalized to USD. total_usd = sum of all infoTable values in the filing (incl. options). pct = position value / total. Tickers suffixed _CALL are call-option lines (value = notional of underlying shares; shares = underlying share count). Matched by issuer name; never held in any quarter: FN, AAOI, CIEN, CRDO, KLAC, TER, ALAB, NBIS, CRWV, OKLO. 'first' = first quarter present; 'exit' = first quarter absent after the last appearance ('' = still held at 2026-06-30). Many names have intermittent gaps (e.g., TSM absent 23Q3-24Q2, AMZN absent 23Q4-24Q3, GOOGL, AVGO, AMD, ENTG) — see trigger_ko for the full in/out path. 13F excludes shorts, non-US-listed and most derivatives. druckQuotes: web search budget was exhausted and fetches were blocked (CAPTCHA/403), so the two quotes are reproduced from memory of widely reported CNBC (2024-05-07 Squawk Box) and Bloomberg TV (2024-10-16) interviews; wording and Bloomberg URL slug should be verified before publication. No reliably datable 2025-2026 Druckenmiller comment on the other names was retrieved."}